  "title": "Cuban Beef Stew",
  "description": "An easily prepared, traditional dish that contains some lively flavors (raisins, stuffed green olives, capers, sherry wine, cumin, and vinegar). Potatoes are added in the final stage of cooking.",
  "authors": [
    "Maryellen"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-10-14T16:24:07-04:00",
